# ...but each demo's launcher IS the documented entry point (the READMEs say to run it),
# so it has to be in the repo. A negation works here because *.sh excludes files, not
# the directories containing them.
!demo*/run.sh
!demo*/run_demo.sh
scratch.py
scratch/
*.pt
*.mp4
*.png
# ...but the gallery preset stills ARE part of the demo -- without them the gallery is
# empty on a fresh clone. Only this one folder per demo, not stray screenshots.
!demo*/assets/*.png
# ...and the README teaser plus the sample cases the inference scripts run on.
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/*.png
